<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">

<head>
    <title>Дистрибьютор</title>
    {% include 'blocks/head.njk' %}
</head>

<body class="preload mp">
    <div class="main-wrapper-outer">
        {% include 'blocks/header.njk' %}
        <main class="main">

            <div class="block-main block-main-distributor">
                <img src="img/list1.webp" alt="" class="block-main__pic1">
                <img src="img/list2.webp" alt="" class="block-main__pic2">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="block-main__contents">
                        <div class="breadcrumbs">
                            <ul>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="#" class="home">
                                        <img src="img/icons/home.svg" alt="">
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li><span>География партнеров</span></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="block-main__content">
                            <div class="block-main__top">
                                <h1 class="title1">
                                    <strong>Дистрибьюторская сеть АО «МИРА»</strong>
                                </h1>
                                <p>
                                    Мы строим прозрачную дистрибуцию по принципу эксклюзивных территорий. <span>Один
                                        город —
                                        один официальный партнер.</span> Проверьте статус вашего региона: если он
                                    свободен, вы
                                    можете получить эксклюзивные права на реализацию наших собственных торговых марок и
                                    импортного портфеля
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="block-distributor">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="block-search">
                        <div class="block-search__input">
                            <div class="block-search__icon">
                                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                    <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#search"></use>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <input autocomplete="off" type="text" name="form[]"
                                placeholder="Введите название города или региона...">
                            <button type="button" class="block-search__delete">
                                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="10" height="10">
                                    <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#close"></use>
                                </svg>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-blue">
                            <span>Найти</span>
                            <span class="btn__arrow">
                                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="9">
                                    <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow1"></use>
                                </svg>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="block-distributor__content">
                        <div class="block-distributor__top">
                            <div class="block-distributor__points">
                                <div class="block-distributor-point">
                                    <div class="block-distributor-point__icon icon-green">
                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#point"></use>
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="block-distributor-point__title">
                                        Регион свободен для партнерства<br>
                                        <span>(Свободно регионов: 47)</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="block-distributor-point">
                                    <div class="block-distributor-point__icon icon-red">
                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#point"></use>
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="block-distributor-point__title">
                                        Эксклюзив выдан (Регион занят)<br>
                                        <span>(Занято регионов: 38)</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="block-distributor__buttons">
                                <button data-filter="1" type="button"
                                    class="block-distributor-button data-filter-button button-map active">
                                    <span>На карте</span>
                                    <div class="block-distributor-button__icon">
                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16">
                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#pin2"></use>
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                                <button data-filter="2" type="button"
                                    class="block-distributor-button data-filter-button button-list">
                                    <span>Списком</span>
                                    <div class="block-distributor-button__icon">
                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="12">
                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#list2"></use>
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="block-distributor__bottom">
                            <div data-filter="1" class="block-distributor__body filter-card">
                                <div class="block-distributor__map">
                                    <img src="img/map.webp" alt="">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div data-filter="2" class="block-distributor__body filter-card">
                                <div data-spollers class="spollers">
                                    <div class="spollers__item">
                                        <button type="button" data-spoller class="spollers__title">
                                            <span>Федеральный округ: Центральный (ЦФО)</span>
                                            <span class="spollers__arrow">
                                                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="12">
                                                    <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow4"></use>
                                                </svg>
                                            </span>
                                        </button>
                                        <div class="spollers__body">
                                            <div class="spollers__columns">
                                                <div class="spollers__column">
                                                    <div class="spollers__name">
                                                        Москва —
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="block-distributor-point">
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__icon icon-red">
                                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#point"></use>
                                                            </svg>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__title">
                                                            <span>Занят (ООО «Столица-Фуд»)</span>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <a href="./" data-popup="#request-busy" class="spollers__link"></a>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="spollers__column">
                                                    <div class="spollers__name">
                                                        Тула —
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="block-distributor-point">
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__icon icon-green">
                                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#point"></use>
                                                            </svg>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__title">
                                                            <span>Свободен</span>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <a href="./" data-popup="#request-free" class="spollers__link">
                                                        <span>Подать заявку</span>
                                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="9">
                                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow1"></use>
                                                        </svg>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="spollers__column">
                                                    <div class="spollers__name">
                                                        Москва —
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="block-distributor-point">
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__icon icon-green">
                                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#point"></use>
                                                            </svg>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__title">
                                                            <span>Свободен</span>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <a href="./" data-popup="#request-free" class="spollers__link">
                                                        <span>Подать заявку</span>
                                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="9">
                                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow1"></use>
                                                        </svg>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="spollers__item">
                                        <button type="button" data-spoller class="spollers__title">
                                            <span>Федеральный округ: Уральский (УрФО)</span>
                                            <span class="spollers__arrow">
                                                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="12">
                                                    <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow4"></use>
                                                </svg>
                                            </span>
                                        </button>
                                        <div class="spollers__body">
                                            <div class="spollers__columns">
                                                <div class="spollers__column">
                                                    <div class="spollers__name">
                                                        Екатеринбург —
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="block-distributor-point">
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__icon icon-red">
                                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#point"></use>
                                                            </svg>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__title">
                                                            <span>Занят (ООО «УралДистрибьюшн»)</span>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <a href="./" data-popup="#request-busy" class="spollers__link"></a>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="spollers__column">
                                                    <div class="spollers__name">
                                                        Челябинск —
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="block-distributor-point">
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__icon icon-green">
                                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#point"></use>
                                                            </svg>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__title">
                                                            <span>Свободен</span>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <a href="./" data-popup="#request-free" class="spollers__link">
                                                        <span>Подать заявку</span>
                                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="9">
                                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow1"></use>
                                                        </svg>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="spollers__column">
                                                    <div class="spollers__name">
                                                        Тюмень —
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="block-distributor-point">
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__icon icon-green">
                                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#point"></use>
                                                            </svg>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="block-distributor-point__title">
                                                            <span>Свободен</span>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <a href="./" data-popup="#request-free" class="spollers__link">
                                                        <span>Подать заявку</span>
                                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="9">
                                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow1"></use>
                                                        </svg>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="block-distributor-descr">
                                <div class="block-distributor-descr__title">
                                    Последние занятые регионы
                                </div>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>
                                        <div class="block-distributor-descr__icon">
                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="13" height="14">
                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#pin"></use>
                                            </svg>
                                        </div>
                                        <span>Иркутск</span>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <div class="block-distributor-descr__icon">
                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="13" height="14">
                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#pin"></use>
                                            </svg>
                                        </div>
                                        <span>Красноярск</span>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <div class="block-distributor-descr__icon">
                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="13" height="14">
                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#pin"></use>
                                            </svg>
                                        </div>
                                        <span>Краснодар</span>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <div class="block-distributor-descr__icon">
                                            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="13" height="14">
                                                <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#pin"></use>
                                            </svg>
                                        </div>
                                        <span>Казань</span>
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="block-section block-section-distr">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="heading-complex">
                        <h2 class="title2">
                            <span>Почему</span> выгодно занять регион прямо сейчас?
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="block-section__body">
                        <div class="block-section__column">
                            <div class="block-section__image">
                                <div class="block-section__circle">
                                    <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="18">
                                        <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#tick"></use>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                <img loading="lazy" src="img/icons/word.svg" alt="" class="block-section__icon">
                            </div>
                            <div class="block-section__item">
                                <div class="block-section__title">
                                    Защита территории
                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    В рамках эксклюзивного партнерства не назначаем второго дистрибьютора на
                                    закрепленную
                                    территорию
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="block-section__column">
                            <div class="block-section__image">
                                <div class="block-section__circle">
                                    <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="18">
                                        <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#tick"></use>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                <img loading="lazy" src="img/icons/warehouse.svg" alt="" class="block-section__icon">
                            </div>
                            <div class="block-section__item">
                                <div class="block-section__title">
                                    Растущий ассортимент
                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    Постоянно расширяем ассортимент за счет новых зарубежных производителей,
                                    перспективных категорий и эксклюзивных продуктов, которые могут отсутствовать на
                                    российском рынке. Вы получаете право первой руки на все новинки
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="block-section__column">
                            <div class="block-section__image">
                                <div class="block-section__circle">
                                    <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="18">
                                        <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#tick"></use>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                <img loading="lazy" src="img/icons/send.svg" alt="" class="block-section__icon">
                            </div>
                            <div class="block-section__item">
                                <div class="block-section__title">
                                    Прямая маршрутизация лидов:
                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    Все розничные заявки (от магазинов, HoReCa, локальных сетей) из вашего города,
                                    поступившие на наш сайт, мы автоматически передаем вам
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="block-forms block-forms5">
                <img src="img/image6.webp" alt="" class="block-forms__pic1">
                <img src="img/image7.webp" alt="" class="block-forms__pic2">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="block-forms__content">
                        <div class="block-forms__left">
                            <div class="heading-complex">
                                <h2 class="title2">
                                    <span>Не нашли свой населенный пункт?</span>
                                </h2>
                                <p>
                                    <strong>Напишите нам.</strong> Мы готовы рассмотреть индивидуальные условия
                                    логистики и партнерства
                                    для городов с населением от 100 000 человек
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="block-forms__buttons">
                            <a href="./" class="btn btn-blue btn-big">
                                <span>Связаться с отделом развития</span>
                                <div class="btn__arrow">
                                    <svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="9">
                                        <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow1"></use>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </main>
        {% include 'blocks/footer.njk' %}
    </div>
    {% include 'blocks/popups.njk' %}
    {% include 'blocks/scripts.njk' %}
</body>

</html>